{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12444","headline":"重赠赵给事 · 钱起","name":"重赠赵给事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久飞鸳掖出时髦，耻负平生稽古劳。\n玉树满庭家转贵，云衢独步位初高。\n能迂驺驭寻蜗舍，不惜瑶华报木桃。\n应念潜郎守贫病，常悲休沐对蓬蒿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}